WEBVTT

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:17.243
<v Host>Welcome to Japanese Daily News. I'm Maya. Today is June eighth. This week, from the fourth to the tenth, is Japan's Dental and Oral Health Week. It's a yearly reminder to take good care of your teeth. Let's listen.

00:00:17.844 --> 00:00:20.603
<v News>今日のニュースです。

00:00:21.303 --> 00:00:28.047
<v News>6月4日から10日までは、「歯と口の健康週間」です。

00:00:28.748 --> 00:00:34.963
<v News>これは、歯を大切にすることを考える1週間です。

00:00:35.664 --> 00:00:40.823
<v News>歯が痛いと、ごはんがおいしく食べられません。

00:00:41.524 --> 00:00:46.875
<v News>だから、毎日歯をみがくことが大切です。

00:00:47.576 --> 00:00:52.783
<v News>朝と夜、特に寝る前にみがくといいです。

00:00:53.484 --> 00:00:58.740
<v News>歯みがきは、3分くらいかけてするといいです。

00:00:59.439 --> 00:01:03.807
<v News>おくの歯も、わすれずにみがきましょう。

00:01:04.507 --> 00:01:09.475
<v News>甘いものを食べすぎないことも、大切です。

00:01:10.176 --> 00:01:14.855
<v News>食べたあとに、口をゆすぐのもいいです。

00:01:15.555 --> 00:01:21.123
<v News>子どもも大人も、ときどき歯医者さんに行きましょう。

00:01:21.823 --> 00:01:26.671
<v News>歯医者さんで、歯をきれいにしてもらえます。

00:01:27.371 --> 00:01:32.171
<v News>健康な歯は、一生の宝物です。

00:01:32.871 --> 00:01:37.623
<v News>元気な歯で、なんでもおいしく食べましょう。

00:01:38.323 --> 00:01:43.867
<v News>今週は、自分の歯について考えてみましょう。

00:01:44.567 --> 00:01:46.200
<v Host>Let's break it down.

00:01:46.799 --> 00:01:54.504
<v Slow>6月4日から10日までは、「歯と口の健康週間」です。

00:01:55.304 --> 00:01:59.263
<v Host>June fourth to the tenth is Dental and Oral Health Week.

00:01:59.864 --> 00:02:01.640
<v Vocab>歯

00:02:02.040 --> 00:02:06.719
<v Host>It means tooth, or teeth. You'll hear it in lots of health and food talk.

00:02:07.319 --> 00:02:13.223
<v Slow>歯が痛いと、ごはんがおいしく食べられません。

00:02:14.024 --> 00:02:17.072
<v Host>When your teeth hurt, you can't enjoy your meals.

00:02:17.671 --> 00:02:19.831
<v Vocab>痛い

00:02:20.231 --> 00:02:26.039
<v Host>It means painful, or it hurts. Use it for anything from a headache to a sore tooth.

00:02:26.639 --> 00:02:32.735
<v Slow>だから、毎日歯をみがくことが大切です。

00:02:33.536 --> 00:02:37.592
<v Host>So, brushing your teeth every day is important.

00:02:38.192 --> 00:02:40.472
<v Vocab>みがく

00:02:40.872 --> 00:02:46.391
<v Host>It means to brush, or to polish. You do it to your teeth, and to shoes too.

00:02:46.991 --> 00:02:52.943
<v Slow>朝と夜、特に寝る前にみがくといいです。

00:02:53.743 --> 00:02:58.111
<v Host>Morning and night — especially before bed — it's good to brush.

00:02:58.711 --> 00:03:00.680
<v Vocab>寝る

00:03:01.080 --> 00:03:06.264
<v Host>It means to sleep, or to go to bed. Here it's the time just before sleeping.

00:03:06.864 --> 00:03:12.527
<v Slow>甘いものを食べすぎないことも、大切です。

00:03:13.328 --> 00:03:16.807
<v Host>Not eating too many sweet things is also important.

00:03:17.407 --> 00:03:19.496
<v Vocab>甘い

00:03:19.895 --> 00:03:25.008
<v Host>It means sweet. Great for candy, tough on your teeth in large amounts.

00:03:25.608 --> 00:03:31.967
<v Slow>子どもも大人も、ときどき歯医者さんに行きましょう。

00:03:32.768 --> 00:03:36.752
<v Host>Children and adults alike should go to the dentist now and then.

00:03:37.352 --> 00:03:39.536
<v Vocab>歯医者

00:03:39.936 --> 00:03:43.367
<v Host>It means dentist — literally the tooth doctor.

00:03:43.967 --> 00:03:49.487
<v Slow>歯医者さんで、歯をきれいにしてもらえます。

00:03:50.288 --> 00:03:53.360
<v Host>At the dentist, you can have your teeth cleaned.

00:03:53.960 --> 00:03:55.975
<v Vocab>きれい

00:03:56.376 --> 00:04:01.656
<v Host>It means clean, and also pretty. Both senses are useful every day.

00:04:02.256 --> 00:04:07.752
<v Slow>健康な歯は、一生の宝物です。

00:04:08.551 --> 00:04:11.527
<v Host>Healthy teeth are a treasure for your whole life.

00:04:12.127 --> 00:04:14.503
<v Vocab>健康

00:04:14.903 --> 00:04:19.391
<v Host>It means health, or healthy. The whole point of this special week.

00:04:19.992 --> 00:04:22.992
<v Host>Let's listen to the full story one more time.

00:04:23.591 --> 00:04:26.351
<v News>今日のニュースです。

