00:05:50.315 --> 00:05:53.052
<v Host>Quiz time. Three questions.

00:05:53.651 --> 00:05:59.315
<v Slow>「歯と口の健康週間」は、いつですか。

00:06:00.115 --> 00:06:04.963
<v Host>When is Dental and Oral Health Week? From June fourth to the tenth.

00:06:05.564 --> 00:06:12.043
<v Slow>歯を健康にするために、毎日何をしますか。

00:06:12.843 --> 00:06:17.644
<v Host>To keep your teeth healthy, what do you do every day? Brush your teeth.

00:06:18.244 --> 00:06:23.572
<v Slow>食べすぎないほうがいいものは、何ですか。

00:06:24.372 --> 00:06:28.139
<v Host>What is it better not to eat too much of? Sweet things.

00:06:28.740 --> 00:06:41.124
<v Host>That's today's Japanese Daily News. Full transcript with furigana at podcast.jpnotes.dev. Subscribe on Apple Podcasts or Spotify. See you tomorrow.

00:06:41.723 --> 00:06:43.980
<v News>また明日。
